From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bsp2020 <bsp2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 23/41] moe cache: a sparse table staged fill at sizing takes
 the heat map hottest experts (GGML_MOE_STAGE_HEAT_RANK=0: off)

With a persisted heat map, the eager per-expert heat seed of a sparse (mmap) table registered each expert and
took ~75 s more load.  The staged fill at sizing already fills the arena through a pinned staging buffer without
registration; it now takes the experts in the rank order of the prior (as apply_heat_seed_locked ranks them)
instead of 0..k-1, and the heat seed leaves sparse tables to it.  No map: 0..k-1 as before.

(cherry picked from commit 503fd28fdf54c505703e79ffec3e444fb33e2ec6)
(cherry picked from commit 0bbfdd9ccf5d54b16259d0c3fd2613c6d17b0e88)
(cherry picked from commit 369771474807ef789f7c60ed4835234e750d1a20)
(cherry picked from commit c075d68b21ac73affae05f356a0a57f15a1095e1)
(cherry picked from commit 7406f646f9af7fdd78fa84035f77803ca4d322fd)
(cherry picked from commit 64eb7cb7085edeef11c4e61ab2882129c2e9ba34)
(cherry picked from commit fd159a436ef9fb429d6541c040dde857cd53676b)
(cherry picked from commit 720a43167ad8ba4c0a996aad04323f112f203fd3)
(cherry picked from commit 5efffd213febe9cfc40c527e6413169a2dac6ae7)
(cherry picked from commit 9af5c001de443017b8b18d759fa0dd258eb408c5)
(cherry picked from commit f10c0372ce4aa96a140e7cc63044d65b30230df0)
